  "english": "oB\nTHE SEVEN-YEAR CYCLE OF THE ROMANS 1.\nHowever, when it is a leap year, and\nthe year-letter is 208 [ԸծՏ], do not celebrate\nthese four feasts, namely: Cyprian, Athanagenes,\nthe Forefathers, and Thaddeus the Apostle,\nat this time. For their feasts are celebrated\nin the last year-letter, 300 [Տ], after Transfiguration,\nas you see. But in place of Cyprian, celebrate Eugene the Virgin,\nand in place of Thaddeus, [celebrate] Gregory the\nTheologian, who was placed above with the other\nfeasts; and in place of Athanagenes\nand the Forefathers, celebrate Andrew the Commander\nand Adrian, who\nare placed below after the Mother of God.\nBut in other years, as it is written,\nso celebrate without doubt.\n29. Monday, Tone 3 [ԴՁ]. Of Cyprian the Bishop,\nand the rest. Father of Tone 1 [ԲՁ]: \"Anokhagal\" [You who do not hold a grudge].\n30. Tuesday, Tone 3 [ԴԿ]. Of Athanagenes the Bishop,\nand the rest. Father of Tone 1 [ԲՁ]: \"Und\nsoorpus ko\" [Among Your saints].\nDecember.\n1. Thursday, Tone 1 [ԱԿ]. Of the Forefathers: Adam,\nAbel, and the rest.\n3. Saturday, Tone 1 [ԲԿ]. Of the sons and grandsons of the\nEnlightener.\n4. Sunday, Tone 2 [ԳՁ]. Fourth. Father of Tone 2 [ԳԿ]: \"Aysor zgenav\" [Today He was armed]. Hymn of the Ascent [Hambartsi] Tone 2 [ԳՁ]: \"I dzayn ahegh\" [At the awesome voice].\n5. Monday, Tone 2 [ԳԿ]. Of the Maccabees, Eleazar,\nand the rest. Father of Tone 1 [ԲԿ]: \"Orhnemk\nzkez Ter\" [We bless You, Lord].\n6. Tuesday, Tone 3 [ԴՁ]. Of the Twelve Prophets:\nHosea, and the rest.\n8. Thursday, Tone 1 [ԱՁ]. Of Sophia and her three\ndaughters, and the rest. Father of Tone 1 [ԲԿ]: \"Ork i\nmarti\" [Who in battle].\nJanuary.\n6. SATURDAY, Tone 3 [ԴԿ]. Feast of the Nativity and Revelation of Christ. The meat-eating period\nis thirty and seven days.\n14. Sunday, Tone 3 [ԴԿ]. First. Hymn of the Ascent [Hambartsi] Tone 3 [ԴԿ]: \"Park Harutean\" [Glory to the Resurrection].\n15. Monday, Tone 1 [ԱՁ]. Of John the Forerunner.\n16. Tuesday, Tone 1 [ԱԿ]. Of Peter the Patriarch,\nBlaise, and the rest.\n17. Wednesday, Tone 1 [ԲՁ]. Father [of penitence] Tone 1 [ԲՁ]: \"Or\nabretsuts'er\" [Who delivered].\n18. Thursday, Tone 1 [ԲԿ]. Of Anthony, — and of Tryphon,\nParsamas, and Onuphrius the\nhermits.\n20. Saturday, Tone 2 [ԳԿ]. Of Theodosius the King, and\nthe Holy Infants of Ephesus.\n21. Sunday, Tone 3 [ԴՁ]. Second. Father of Tone 1 [ԲԿ]: \"Kamavoruteamp yegir\" [By Your free will You came]. Hymn of the Ascent [Hambartsi] Tone 2 [ԳՁ]:\n\"Zharutiun astuadzordvoyn\" [The resurrection of the Son of God].\n22. Monday, Tone 3 [ԴԿ]. Of Cyriacus and Julietta,\n— and of Gordius, and the rest. Father of Tone 1 [ԱՁ]:\n\"Zkez artar\" [You, the righteous].\n23. Tuesday, Tone 1 [ԱՁ]. Of Vahan of Goghtn,\n— and of Eugene the Virgin, and the rest.\nFather of Tone 1 [ԱԿ]: \"Surb astuadz ararich\" [Holy God, Creator]...\n25. Thursday, Tone 1 [ԲՁ]. Of Eugenius, Macarius,\nand the rest. Father of Tone 1 [ԱԿ]: \"Or partsreald\nes\" [You who are exalted].\n27. Saturday, Tone 2 [ԳՁ]. Of the Patriarchs Athanasius\nand Cyril, — and of Gregory the\nTheologian.\n28. Sunday, Tone 2 [ԳԿ]. Third. Father of Tone 2 [ԳՁ]: \"Ararichd araradzots\" [Creator of creatures]. Hymn of the Ascent [Hambartsi] Tone 2 [ԳԿ]: \"Tesil paylaknadzev\" [The appearance of lightning]. For what is written hereafter,\nlook after Transfiguration; but\nlook here for the Fathers and the tones.",
